==English==

===Etymology===
Deliberately altered spelling of [[lead]], to avoid confusion with a strip of type metal used for positioning type in the frame. Cf. [[#Middle English|Middle English]] below. Note the pronunciations are already distinct.

===Pronunciation===
* {{enPR|lēd}}
* {{IPA|/lɪid/}}
* {{SAMPA|/li:d/}}

===Noun===
{{en-noun}}

# {{journalism|jargon}} The [[introduction|introductory]] [[paragraph|paragraph(s)]] of a [[newspaper]] or other [[article]].

====Quotations====
*''For examples of the use of this word see: [[Citations:lede|Citations]]''

